   "json": {
    "id": "sam-n-max",
    "name": "Sam & Max as Jacob & Esau",
    "version": "1.5",
    "author": "Unknown",
    "description": "[h3]From the bowels of New York to the bowels of the basement, taking the place of Jacob & Esau, it’s Sam & Max, Freelance Police![/h3]\n\nIf you clicked on this mod I assume you already know who they are and if so you have good taste! I fell into this fandom headfirst a few months ago, and after a year of not playing I got back into TBOI so why not smash my interests together? It reskins all the necessary stuff to turn everyone's least(?) favourite doomed brothers into a crime fighting dog-rabbit duo, including a handful of custom costumes. This is my first mod so have mercy and expect some jankiness!\n\nI'm genuinely blown away by the amount of love this has gotten, always love to see other fans of this franchise in the wild ❤️ Thank you to everyone past, present and future! Rest assured I'm working on more content >:3\n\nComing soon!\nMore custom costumes\nMore easter eggs and goodies\nTainted Sam (in progress!)\n\nWho knows, if we’re lucky maybe making this mod will finally motivate me to get the rest of their completion marks. Happy basement diving! \n\n([b]This mod is built for repentance+, playing on base repentance may cause issues! It will also probably conflict with other reskin mods, unfortunately there isn't much I can do about this[/b])\n\n[i]All mod content is made by me, and Sam & Max themselves are of course the brainchild of Steve Purcell[/i]"
   }
  },
